
                       geant4-11-03-ref-00
                       ===================

Major development/fixes included since the last development tag are:

 o Added new 5D model for e+e- pair production by muons; classes
   G4RiGeMuPairProductionModel and G4RiGeAngularGenerator.
 o Updated adjoint simulation classes to allow running adjoint simulation
   in MT mode.
 o Optimised G4ChargeExchangeXS, switching computations from level of
   isotopes to level of elements and making the code running faster
   without loss of accuracy.
 o Tuned verbose levels to reduce printouts during event loop.
 o New datasets: G4PhotonEvaporation-6.1, G4RadioactiveDecay-6.1.2.

