processes/hadronic
------------------
- cross_sections (hadr-cross-V11-02-18)
  o G4ChargeExchangeXS: switch computations from level of isotopes to level of
    elements; code becomes several times faster and accuracy is not lost.
    Added protections against negative components of cross-section and potential
    division by zero, which may be only possible at extreme high energy.
    Fixed problem in pion cross-sections according to prescription in the
    original paper. Handle special case of positive meson scattering off
    Hydrogen, the cross-section is propotional to the percent of deuterons.
- models/coherent_elastic (hadr-cohe-V11-02-03)
  o In G4ChargeExchange, fixed problem of the Hydrogen target; change event
    weight if cross-section biasing factor is applied.
  o Added warning in G4ChargeExchangeProcess.

